OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ACan Europe recharge its battery
OL,4,Aindustry?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the length of time required to
OL,7,Fbring new products to market, coupled
OL,8,Fwith brutal competition, especially
OL,9,Ffrom China, means taking a substantial
OL,10,Frisk.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
