OL,3,AOasis tease tour announcement with
OL,4,Adrone display
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis put on a drone show over their
OL,7,Fhome city to announce their upcoming
OL,8,Ftour.
OL,10,FThe band illuminated the sky over the
OL,11,FEtihad's Joie Stadium, home to
OL,12,FManchester City Women, on Thursday
OL,13,Fevening.
OL,15,FA drone formation showed the band's
OL,16,Flogo and was replaced by the date
OL,17,F14.09.26 and the time 4pm BST [16:00],
OL,18,Fwhich is when the announcement expected
OL,19,Fto happen.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
